B.Op=s(["Your email address and a hashed form of your password (we cannot read it). If you sign in with Google, we get your email and a Google account identifier, never your Google password.","The country you chose. Your subscription state, and a reference from our payment provider. We never see or store your card number.","The phone details we need to send alerts: a push token, the phone type and app version, and when each device was last used. Your notification choices.","When you accepted each legal document, which version, and the network address you were on at the time.","Error reports from the app, with email addresses and long codes removed before we store them."],t.s)
B.MK=new A.dv("What we collect",B.Op)
B.OF=s(["To run your account, check that you have access, send the alerts you asked for, take payment, keep the service safe, and meet legal and accounting duties. We do not use it to build advertising profiles."],t.s)
B.Mw=new A.dv("Why we use it",B.OF)
B.O6=s(["Only the companies that do part of the job for us: the payment provider, an email delivery service for the codes we send you, and Google's Firebase service to deliver push alerts. They may only use your data to do that job. We share information with authorities only when the law requires it."],t.s)
B.MG=new A.dv("Who else sees it",B.O6)
B.MU=s(["For as long as your account exists. When you delete your account we remove your email, password, devices, alerts, preferences and any Google link, and the network address on your consent record. We keep a record that an account existed, with its consent history and payment history, because the law and our accounts require it. That record no longer contains your email address."],t.s)
B.MF=new A.dv("How long we keep it",B.MU)
B.OI=s(["You can change your password and email, see and sign out your devices, and delete your account in the app. To ask for a copy of what we hold, or to correct something, write to us through Help. We follow the data protection law that applies to you."],t.s)
B.MA=new A.dv("Your choices",B.OI)
B.NT=s(["Passwords are stored hashed. Traffic between the app and our servers is encrypted. Sign-in codes expire quickly and work once. No system is perfectly safe, so please use a password you do not use anywhere else."],t.s)
B.ML=new A.dv("Security",B.NT)
B.NV=s(["GBL is for people aged 18 and over. We do not knowingly keep information about anyone younger."],t.s)
B.MD=new A.dv("Children",B.NV)
B.P4=s(["If we change how we use your data we will tell you in the app before it takes effect."],t.s)
B.Ms=new A.dv("Changes",B.P4)
B.Pz=s([B.MK,B.Mw,B.MG,B.MF,B.MA,B.ML,B.MD,B.Ms],t.J8)
B.Ml=new A.F5("Privacy Policy","What we keep about you, why, and what you can do about it. We do not sell your data and we do not run ads.",B.Pz)
B.Om=s(["Futures are leveraged. A small move in the market can mean a large gain or a large loss, and losses can be bigger than the money in your account. Many people who trade futures lose money. Only trade money you can afford to lose."],t.s)
B.ME=new A.dv("You can lose more than you put in",B.Om)
B.Q7=s(["A signal is a trade idea that the GBL desk publishes to every subscriber at the same time. It is not made for you. We do not know your finances, your experience, your other positions or your limits, so a signal is not advice for your situation. You decide whether to take a trade, how big to make it and when to get out."],t.s)
B.Mr=new A.dv("What a signal is",B.Q7)
B.NE=s(["Results in this app come from the signals GBL published. They are measured in R, which is a multiple of the amount risked on each trade: a stop-out is -1R, a trade that makes twice its risk is +2R.","These results are worked out from the signal levels, before commissions, fees, slippage and taxes. They are not the results of any customer account, and nobody traded them on your behalf.","Hypothetical or simulated performance results have certain inherent limitations. Unlike an actual performance record, simulated results do not represent actual trading. Also, since the trades have not been executed, the results may have under- or over-compensated for the impact, if any, of certain market factors, such as lack of liquidity. No representation is being made that any account will or is likely to achieve profits or losses similar to those shown.","Past results do not predict future results. Any period can be good or bad."],t.s)
B.MI=new A.dv("How results are shown",B.NE)
B.Py=s(["Prices move between the moment a signal is posted and the moment you act. Markets can gap past a stop. Your broker may fill you at a different price, charge fees, or reject the order. Market orders can fill far from the price in the signal when the market is fast or thin."],t.s)
B.Mu=new A.dv("Why your fills will differ",B.Py)
B.Oh=s(["Notifications depend on your phone, your network and your phone maker's battery settings, and sometimes on services we do not control. They can be late or never arrive. Do not rely on alerts alone. Open the app to check what is live, and check the time a signal was posted."],t.s)
B.MB=new A.dv("Alerts can fail",B.Oh)
B.OT=s(["GBL does not place orders, hold your money or connect to your broker account. You place every trade yourself, with your own broker, at your own risk."],t.s)
B.Mp=new A.dv("We do not trade for you",B.OT)
B.On=s([B.ME,B.Mr,B.MI,B.Mu,B.MB,B.Mp],t.J8)
B.Mm=new A.F5("Risk Disclosure","Read this before you use any signal. It is the part of GBL that matters most.",B.On)
B.P_=s(['GBL Capital publishes futures trade ideas ("signals") for NQ, ES, YM and RTY, keeps a permanent record of each one, and shows the results. It is an information service. It is not a broker, it does not hold your money, and it does not place trades.'],t.s)
B.MC=new A.dv("What GBL is",B.P_)
B.N0=s(["You must be at least 18. GBL is not offered in every country, and the app asks where you live when you sign up. You are responsible for making sure that using GBL is legal where you are. We may refuse or end access where it is not."],t.s)
B.MH=new A.dv("Who can use it",B.N0)
B.O7=s(["A new account gets 7 days of full access for free. After that, access continues only while you have an active subscription at $20 a month, in US dollars. If you do nothing when the trial ends, access simply stops and you are not charged.","You can cancel in the app under Profile, then Billing. You keep access until the end of the period you have already paid for, and you are not charged again. If you think you were charged by mistake, write to us through Help and we will look at it.","If a payment fails you keep access for 3 days while you fix it. After that, access pauses until the payment goes through."],t.s)
B.Mv=new A.dv("The trial and the subscription",B.O7)
B.MW=s(["One account is for one person. Keep your password to yourself and tell us if you think someone else has it. You are responsible for what happens under your account."],t.s)
B.Mx=new A.dv("Your account",B.MW)
B.OU=s(["Do not copy, resell, republish or share signals or results outside your own use, including in public channels or to other people for pay. Do not scrape the app, break its security, or use it in a way that harms other people or the service."],t.s)
B.Mo=new A.dv("What you may not do",B.OU)
B.P5=s(["Every signal is saved with the levels it was posted at. Those levels cannot be edited afterwards. Changes, such as moving a stop, are added as new events with a time and a reason. If we make a mistake we show the correction as a new event rather than rewriting history."],t.s)
B.My=new A.dv("The record",B.P5)
B.NC=s(["Signals are ideas, not promises. We do not guarantee that any signal will make money, that the service will always be available, or that alerts will arrive on time. Read the Risk Disclosure: it is part of these terms."],t.s)
B.MJ=new A.dv("No guarantees",B.NC)
B.PO=s(["As far as the law allows, GBL is not responsible for trading losses, missed trades, late or missing alerts, or anything else that follows from the decisions you make. Nothing here limits responsibility that the law does not allow us to limit."],t.s)
B.Mz=new A.dv("Our responsibility",B.PO)
B.NQ=s(["We may change the service or these terms. When the terms change we will ask you to accept the new version in the app before you carry on. You can stop using GBL and delete your account at any time under Profile. We may suspend or close an account that breaks these terms."],t.s)
B.Mq=new A.dv("Changes and ending",B.NQ)
B.Ox=s(["Use Help in the app to reach us."],t.s)
B.Mt=new A.dv("Contact",B.Ox)
B.PJ=s([B.MC,B.MH,B.Mv,B.Mx,B.Mo,B.My,B.MJ,B.Mz,B.Mq,B.Mt],t.J8)
B.Mn=new A.F5("Terms of Service","These are the rules for using GBL Capital. By creating an account you agree to them.",B.PJ)
